{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415807","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415807","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041580701:1":{"text":"アニエル……アニエルじゃないか！","source_cn":"阿妮芮尔……你是阿妮芮尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07C7D935CCD6B2C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041580702:1":{"text":"ああ、デューラ様……アニエル、なんだってそんな姿に！？","source_cn":"艾雅在上，你怎么会变成这副模样？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA6395AA573F801D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041580703:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041580704:1":{"text":"あたしだよ、忘れたのかい？アレクシアだ。昔はあたしと――","source_cn":"你不认得我了吗？我是亚莉克希啊，以前我们——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x151D3AE9295DB5E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041580705:1":{"text":"茶番は結構です、アレクシア。凡俗の感情など、あなたには似つかわしくありません。","source_cn":"别惺惺作态了，亚莉克希。凡人的情绪不适合出现在你脸上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F329AE94B475BEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041580706:1":{"text":"くだらぬ凡俗を観察しているうちに、すっかり毒されたようですね。","source_cn":"你那无趣的观察凡人的爱好果然把你害得不浅。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA6FD527AC9EC2F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041580707:1":{"text":"自らセレスチアルの格を落とすなんて……","source_cn":"你是半神，别自降身份。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98B906D0E490694C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041580708:1":{"text":"……あんた、なんてことを言うんだい。アニエルは、そんなことを言う子じゃないよ！","source_cn":"……你怎么能说出这样的话？这根本不像你，阿妮芮尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x156BF1F14333FD45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041580709:1":{"text":"――<shk>二度とその名前で呼ばないでください！アニエルはもう死んだのです！</shk>","source_cn":"——<shk>别再这样称呼我！阿妮芮尔早就死了！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x813099A3E78BD23B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041580710:1":{"text":"否定しても無駄だよ。神兵であんたを知らない者はいないんだからね！","source_cn":"再怎么否认也没用，所有神兵都认得你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC891CF496EC0BBA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041580711:1":{"text":"やっと見つけたんだ、今日は何が何でも連れて帰るよ。大丈夫、あんたがどんな罪を犯しても、デューラ様はきっと許してくれるさ。","source_cn":"你失踪了那么久，今天我一定要把你带回去。无论你犯下了什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE297D5F3A1E99E92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041580712:1":{"text":"……いいかげんにしてください。","source_cn":"……够了。<key:dialog18>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB24BFD85E15F5860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041580713:1":{"text":"救世主のつもりですか？あなたの救いなど必要ありません。","source_cn":"你不是救世主，我更不需要你来救赎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9DE695AD6BAA810","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041580714:1":{"text":"カタストロフになることを選んだ瞬間から、私とあなたは敵同士なのです。","source_cn":"恶魔的身份是我自己的选择。从那一刻起，我们就已经是敌人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB881A646DF0C71D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041580715:1":{"text":"次に会ったとき、弓を引かなければ、私のノコギリがあなたの命を奪いますよ。","source_cn":"下一次，如果你不拿起你的翼弓，我会用轮锯取走你的命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D0871B44A4311FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:亚莉克希":{"text":"アレクシア","source":"亚莉克希","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:恩妮瑞尔":{"text":"ウェニエル","source":"恩妮瑞尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":2}}